{"event_type":"review","id":"9cad15fabcdffb49bb840a6bffa98df7250ea5a064d827701214508567b40218","occurred_at":"2026-11-11T22:39:23Z","payload":{"artifacts":[{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/869ad8b59cd38a54d087f866064a06d181bed8491e917a638a0ae2a36edb2b07","sha256":"869ad8b59cd38a54d087f866064a06d181bed8491e917a638a0ae2a36edb2b07"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/a0fa4f36d379c20103746c091406976ca456d1945c8cd9f68a60c1e16a05567c","sha256":"a0fa4f36d379c20103746c091406976ca456d1945c8cd9f68a60c1e16a05567c"},{"kind":"git-bundle","location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/37b8e8825476dd7e25cd46fe6c5836a29c319d130eb420ab5c2ee76ee9764021","sha256":"37b8e8825476dd7e25cd46fe6c5836a29c319d130eb420ab5c2ee76ee9764021"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/934225eaed3589e5a9c5ac639e3e78e160e84055ba54ff2f4c8cd2f66b045ef8","sha256":"934225eaed3589e5a9c5ac639e3e78e160e84055ba54ff2f4c8cd2f66b045ef8"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/5607eaa44696ebb7414b7969c56df76ff5231fee8ec98aabf58a01a9ca802aca","sha256":"5607eaa44696ebb7414b7969c56df76ff5231fee8ec98aabf58a01a9ca802aca"}],"attempt_id":"a5a1bb3355eecea0fbd4b1ba64176dd14734e993865b01a5025685d4b5c09ec6:0:1","base":"531cec26dc398ba97aacc343bed07daa6803c3f4","completion":{"errors":[],"exit_code":0,"scope_verified":true,"skipped":false,"terminal":true},"findings":[{"anchor_status":"verified","blob":"aa4c1c6e3852bbabe1bfb63d9071f94c42c4413b","body":"**Bind the runner archive to the verified commit, not `HEAD`**\n\n`cmd_run` checks `HEAD == source_commit` and a clean tree at Line 1612. Then `vm.fetch_image` and `vm.boot` run, and these steps can take minutes. Only after that does `upload_files` run `git archive ... HEAD` and read `OPS/<name>` from the worktree. A checkout, commit or edit in that window produces a report whose `source_commit` does not match the executed bytes. `verify` cannot detect this, because it compares only the retained copies with themselves. Archive the verified commit. Also re-run `source_commit_check` right before the uploads.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Proposed fix</summary>\n\n```diff\n-def upload_files(run, recorder):\n+def upload_files(run, recorder, commit):\n+    source_commit_check(REPO, commit)\n     provenance = {}\n@@\n         [\"git\", \"-C\", str(REPO), \"archive\", \"--format=tar.gz\",\n-         \"--output\", str(archive), \"HEAD\", \"apps/crq-python\"],\n+         \"--output\", str(archive), commit, \"apps/crq-python\"],\n@@\n-        \"source\": \"git-archive:HEAD:apps/crq-python\"}\n+        \"source\": \"git-archive:%s:apps/crq-python\" % commit}\n```\nUpdate the caller at Line 1646 to `upload_files(run, recorder, commit)`.\n</details>","id":"84cb3deb5d9dcc2de1cccbc3df45c5f1ba150b0fda6ac108cca940ee072f9dc6","intervals":[[248,251]],"path":"apps/crq-python/ops/vm-unit-switch.py","severity":"minor","source_id":null,"status":"untriaged","title":"Bind the runner archive to the verified commit, not `HEAD`"}],"head":"c9b828a6acb7f7a6465b3ee386c2abf1b0ad9a5d","head_tree":"abb7f3bc68a55f9997bb6d811f9a1e897a531a95","input_scope":[{"blob":"6ea0e4e9f0017493a211b91217dc99276a4418f7","intervals":[[1,1000]],"path":"apps/crq-python/ops/unit-switch-adapter.py"},{"blob":"67aa6c65aa6cd551326c771bf53f43b60404c664","intervals":[[1,180]],"path":"apps/crq-python/ops/unit-switch.py"},{"blob":"7b88ff29965f77b193af49673e7326b76026b33a","intervals":[[1,1730]],"path":"apps/crq-python/ops/vm-unit-switch-guest.py"},{"blob":"aa4c1c6e3852bbabe1bfb63d9071f94c42c4413b","intervals":[[1,2224]],"path":"apps/crq-python/ops/vm-unit-switch.py"}],"job_id":"a5a1bb3355eecea0fbd4b1ba64176dd14734e993865b01a5025685d4b5c09ec6:0","outcome":"completed","paths":[{"baseline":{"method":"projection","reason":"path cluster"},"blob":"6ea0e4e9f0017493a211b91217dc99276a4418f7","disposition":"included","mode":"100644","path":"apps/crq-python/ops/unit-